WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:04,500
Lao Liu, drive slower

2
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,480
This is asking for help

3
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,560
What age is this?

4
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,880
There are also Huangpizi asking for the wind

5
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,560
How can one speculate on spiritual practice?

6
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,080
He said he had to blame me if he failed to appeal to others.

7
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,000
Said that he would suffer thunder disaster in the future

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,780
Not to mention that I just ignored him. If you have something to say, talk to him.

9
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:27,100
You come down first, I won’t leave

10
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:30,370
What do you want to do?

11
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,440
Don't touch his real body, he just got it

12
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,680
Can't speak yet

13
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,120
Now the original god is out of body

14
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,720
This way you can communicate with him

15
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,720
But you have to be popular

16
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:41,640
He can't go back

17
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,760
Little Tongli, help me

18
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,760
Dare to ask the old immortal Minghui

19
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,440
Come to me today. What do you want?

20
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,640
nameless mountain

21
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,440
Don’t panic, little one

22
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,960
I came here today to ask for something.

23
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,140
Lao Xian, I won’t get sick either.

24
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:59,100
How about I take you to the pet hospital?

25
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,300
Huang Dachui, why is my tongue numb?

26
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:02,260
Are you polite?

27
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:03,660
What Xiao Tong said is also there

28
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:04,780
But that's not what I'm asking for

29
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:05,740
Also swear an oath in the name of the Immortal Family

30
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:08,220
My wife and daughter live in the back hill of Zhoujia Village

31
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:09,740
I went out looking for something to eat a few days ago.

32
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:10,900
Spotted by an eagle

33
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:12,060
The tail is caught

34
00:01:12,060 --> 00:01:14,300
I was so blind that one of his eyes fell off.

35
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:15,820
I can’t have this real body anymore.

36
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:18,060
The back mountain is the Tibetan mountain

37
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,020
The legendary corrupt official

38
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,460
Take the gold and silver to kill and hide in there.

39
00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:21,380
A place I’ve never been out of again

40
00:01:21,380 --> 00:01:23,420
I can't go back, I just want to be in this mountain

41
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:25,980
Give their mother and daughter a new place without you raising them.

42
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:30,420
Okay, I'll help you with this

43
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:32,700
Don't worry, it's so dark that you can't see the road.

44
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,420
I'll go back and get a flashlight first
